with `RUNTIME_UNKNOWN_ID`. `fastskill eval validate --all` reports which keys are detected in *your* environment."},"2049":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-22","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#prerequisites","content":"Deterministic validation and scoring need no model credential. Target execution needs the\nselected runtime's authentication; native judges separately need their configured endpoint,\nmodel, and credential environment variable. Embedding configuration is unrelated."},"2050":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-23","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#1-the-toolfastskilleval-table","content":"Add this table to `skill-project.toml`. Every path is resolved relative to the **skill project root** (the directory containing `skill-project.toml`) unless it's absolute."},"2051":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-24","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#1-the-toolfastskilleval-table","content":"Field"},"2052":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-25","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#1-the-toolfastskilleval-table","content":"Type"},"2053":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-26","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#1-the-toolfastskilleval-table","content":"Required"},"2054":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-27","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#1-the-toolfastskilleval-table","content":"Default"},"2055":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-28","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#1-the-toolfastskilleval-table","content":"Meaning"},"2056":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-29","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#1-the-toolfastskilleval-table","content":"`prompts`"},"2057":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-30","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup",