killeval-table","content":"no"},"2079":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-52","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#1-the-toolfastskilleval-table","content":"unset (CPU core count)"},"2080":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-53","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#1-the-toolfastskilleval-table","content":"Max concurrent trials for one case."},"2081":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-54","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#1-the-toolfastskilleval-table","content":"`pass_threshold`"},"2082":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-55","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#1-the-toolfastskilleval-table","content":"float"},"2083":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-56","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#1-the-toolfastskilleval-table","content":"no"},"2084":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-57","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#1-the-toolfastskilleval-table","content":"`1.0`"},"2085":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-58","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#1-the-toolfastskilleval-table","content":"Fraction of trials that must pass for a case to be marked passed; validated to `[0.0, 1.0]` (`EVAL_INVALID_THRESHOLD` otherwise)."},"2086":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-59","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#1-the-toolfastskilleval-table","content":"`fail_on_missing_agent`"},"2087":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-60","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#1-the-toolfastskilleval-table","content":"bool"},"2088":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-61","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#1-the-toolfastskilleval-table","content":"no"},"2089":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-62","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#1-the-toolfastskilleval-table","content":"**`true`**"},"2090":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-63","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#1-the-toolfastskilleval-table","content":"If true, `eval run` and `eval validate --agent <key>` error with `EVAL_AGENT_UNAVAILABLE` when the chosen agent isn't installed."},"2091":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-64","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#1-the-toolfastskilleval-table","content":"**Defaults verified against source** (`crates/fastskill-core/src/core/manifest.rs::EvalConfigToml`): `timeout_seconds` defaults to **900**, and `fail_on_missing_agent` defaults to **true** — the CLI refuses to run against a missing agent unless you explicitly set it to `false`. Don't assume otherwise from older examples."},"2092":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-65","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#1-the-toolfastskilleval-table","content":"With no `checks` file configured, each case still receives the required skill-consultation expectation implied by `should_trigger`. A successful process exit alone is not enough. Add a checks file for further deterministic outcome or adherence evidence."},"2093":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-66","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#validate-the-config","content":"Real output against a working config (this one set `timeout_seconds = 120` and `fail_on_missing_agent = false`):"},"2094":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-67","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#validate-the-config","content":"(`parallel: 0` here just means \"unset\" in the table renderer — the runner still falls back to CPU core count.) A broken `checks.toml` fails validation immediately, e.g.:"},"2095":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-68","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#validate-the-config","content":"A prompts CSV missing a required column fails the same way:"},"2096":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-69","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#2-the-prompts-csv","content":"The suite loader (`aikit-evals::suite`) reads a header row with **required** columns `id`, `prompt`, `should_trigger`, plus optional `tags` and `workspace_subdir`."},"2097":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-70","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#2-the-prompts-csv","content":"Column"},"2098":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-71","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#2-the-prompts-csv","content":"Required"},"2099":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-72","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#2-the-prompts-csv","content":"Meaning"},"2100":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-73","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#2-the-prompts-csv","content":"`id`"},"2101":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-74","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#2-the-prompts-csv","content":"yes"},"2102":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-75","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#2-the-prompts-csv","content":"Non-empty identifier per row. Used for `--case`, artifact folder names, and reports."},"2103":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-76","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#2-the-prompts-csv","content":"`prompt`"},"2104":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-77","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#2-the-prompts-csv","content":"yes"},"2105":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-78","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#2-the-prompts-csv","content":"Text sent to the agent. Use CSV quoting (`\"...\"`, doubled `\"\"` for an embedded quote) for commas or newlines."},"2106":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-79","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#2-the-prompts-csv","content":"`should_trigger`"},"2107":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-80","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#2-the-prompts-csv","content":"yes"},"2108":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-81","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#2-the-prompts-csv","content":"`true`/`1` (case-insensitive `true`) or anything else counts as `false`. It creates a required per-case skill-consultation expectation; see below."},"2109":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-82","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#2-the-prompts-csv","content":"`tags`"},"2110":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-83","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#2-the-prompts-csv","content":"no"},"2111":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-84","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#2-the-prompts-csv","content":"Comma-separated tags inside the cell (e.g. `\"smoke,basic\"`). Used by `eval run --tag <name>`."},"2112":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-85","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#2-the-prompts-csv","content":"`workspace_subdir`"},"2113":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-86","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#2-the-prompts-csv","content":"no"},"2114":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-87","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#2-the-prompts-csv","content":"Relative path that becomes the agent's working directory for the case. Under the default isolation it is created **inside the case's scratch workspace**, with fixture files copied in from the same path under the project root; under `--no-isolation` it resolves directly under the project root. Empty or omitted → workspace root."},"2115":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-88","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#2-the-prompts-csv","content":"Empty lines are skipped."},"2116":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-89","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#2-the-prompts-csv","content":"**`should_trigger` affects pass/fail.** The engine creates an implicit required `skill_invoked` check for each case, with `expected` equal to the CSV value. An explicit `skill_invoked` check that applies to the case replaces the implicit one; `eval validate` rejects a contradictory polarity. Therefore `false` tests non-consultation and `true` tests consultation, subject to the selected backend's observability."},"2117":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-90","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#2-the-prompts-csv","content":"This is adherence/selection evidence, not outcome correctness. A structured `Skill` call is direct evidence; supported decoders may also recognize a tool input that references the staged skill-document path. The path proxy indicates consultation, not that the instructions were read or followed. Pair positive cases with outcome checks or judges."},"2118":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-91","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#3-checks-checkstoml-optional","content":"Point `checks` at a TOML file with one or more `[[check]]` tables, keyed by the required `name` field. There are exactly five check types (`aikit_evals::checks::CheckDefinition`):"},"2119":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-92","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#3-checks-checkstoml-optional","content":"**Checks score the canonical trace, never raw stdout.** Every check below matches against the run's `trace.jsonl` — the parsed, structured event stream. Raw stdout is deliberately excluded: with the `claude` agent it opens with a `system`/`project init` event listing **every skill installed in the environment**, which used to make any skill-name pattern pass vacuously. Assistant text still reaches the trace as message events, so matching on what the agent actually said continues to work."},"2120":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-93","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#skill_invoked","content":"The check you almost certainly want for \"did my skill fire?\"."},"2121":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-94","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#skill_invoked","content":"Field"},"2122":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-95","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#skill_invoked","content":"Type"},"2123":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-96","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#skill_invoked","content":"Required"},"2124":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-97","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#skill_invoked","content":"Default"},"2125":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-98","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#skill_invoked","content":"`skill`"},"2126":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-99","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#skill_invoked","content":"string"},"2127":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-100","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#skill_invoked","content":"no"},"2128":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-101","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#skill_invoked","content":"— (omit to match *any* skill invocation)"},"2129":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-102","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#skill_invoked","content":"`expected`"},"2130":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-103","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#skill_invoked","content":"bool"},"2131":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-104","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#skill_invoked","content":"no"},"2132":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-105","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#skill_invoked","content":"`true` (`false` asserts the skill did **not** run)"},"2133":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-106","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#skill_invoked","content":"`required`"},"2134":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-107","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#skill_invoked","content":"bool"},"2135":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-108","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#skill_invoked","content":"no"},"2136":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-109","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#skill_invoked","content":"`true`"},"2137":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-110","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#skill_invoked","content":"`cases`"},"2138":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-111","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#skill_invoked","content":"string array"},"2139":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-112","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#skill_invoked","content":"no"},"2140":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-113","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#skill_invoked","content":"all cases (exact case IDs)"},"2141":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-114","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#skill_invoked","content":"Matches a structured `Skill` invocation or, where the decoder supplies it, a tool input referring to the staged skill-document path. When `skill` is given, a structured invocation must exactly match its identifying field. A skill name merely mentioned in unrelated prose does not count. Path-reference matching improves portability but remains a consultation proxy rather than proof of adherence."},"2142":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-115","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#skill_invoked","content":"Every check type supports `cases = [\"case-id\", ...]`, selecting exact case IDs. An absent selector applies to every case. Use selectors for checks that should not run across a mixed suite."},"2143":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-116","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#trigger_expectation","content":"Field"},"2144":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-117","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#trigger_expectation","content":"Type"},"2145":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-118","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#trigger_expectation","content":"Required"},"2146":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-119","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#trigger_expectation","content":"Default"},"2147":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-120","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#trigger_expectation","content":"`pattern`"},"2148":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-121","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#trigger_expectation","content":"string"},"2149":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-122","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#trigger_expectation","content":"yes"},"2150":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-123","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#trigger_expectation","content":"—"},"2151":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-124","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#trigger_expectation","content":"`expected`"},"2152":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-125","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#trigger_expectation","content":"bool"},"2153":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-126","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#trigger_expectation","content":"yes"},"2154":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-127","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#trigger_expectation","content":"— (`true` = pattern must appear, `false` = must NOT appear)"},"2155":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-128","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#trigger_expectation","content":"`required`"},"2156":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-129","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#trigger_expectation","content":"bool"},"2157":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-130","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#trigger_expectation","content":"no"},"2158":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-131","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#trigger_expectation","content":"`true`"},"2159":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-132","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#trigger_expectation","content":"Matches `pattern` as a **plain substring** against the JSONL trace. Prefer `skill_invoked` for asserting that a skill ran; treat `trigger_expectation` as the escape hatch for matching arbitrary text the agent produced."},"2160":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-133","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#command_contains","content":"Field"},"2161":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-134","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#command_contains","content":"Type"},"2162":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-135","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#command_contains","content":"Required"},"2163":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-136","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#command_contains","content":"Default"},"2164":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-137","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#command_contains","content":"`pattern`"},"2165":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-138","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#command_contains","content":"string"},"2166":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-139","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#command_contains","content":"yes"},"2167":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-140","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#command_contains","content":"—"},"2168":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-141","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#command_contains","content":"`required`"},"2169":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-142","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#command_contains","content":"bool"},"2170":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-143","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#command_contains","content":"no"},"2171":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-144","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#command_contains","content":"`true`"},"2172":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-145","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#command_contains","content":"Same trace substring search as `trigger_expectation`, without the pass/fail inversion — passes if the pattern is found anywhere in the trace."},"2173":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-146","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#file_exists","content":"Field"},"2174":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-147","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#file_exists","content":"Type"},"2175":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-148","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#file_exists","content":"Required"},"2176":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-149","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#file_exists","content":"Default"},"2177":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-150","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#file_exists","content":"`path`"},"2178":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-151","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#file_exists","content":"path"},"2179":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-152","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#file_exists","content":"yes"},"2180":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-153","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#file_exists","content":"—"},"2181":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-154","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#file_exists","content":"`required`"},"2182":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-155","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#file_exists","content":"bool"},"2183":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-156","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#file_exists","content":"no"},"2184":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-157","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#file_exists","content":"`true`"},"2185":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-158","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#file_exists","content":"Passes if `path` exists under the case's working directory — the case's scratch workspace under the default isolation (plus `workspace_subdir` when set), or the project root under `--no-isolation`."},"2186":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-159","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#max_tool_calls-alias-max_command_count","content":"Field"},"2187":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-160","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#max_tool_calls-alias-max_command_count","content":"Type"},"2188":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-161","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#max_tool_calls-alias-max_command_count","content":"Required"},"2189":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-162","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#max_tool_calls-alias-max_command_count","content":"Default"},"2190":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-163","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#max_tool_calls-alias-max_command_count","content":"`limit`"},"2191":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-164","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#max_tool_calls-alias-max_command_count","content":"integer"},"2192":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-165","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#max_tool_calls-alias-max_command_count","content":"yes"},"2193":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-166","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#max_tool_calls-alias-max_command_count","content":"—"},"2194":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-167","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#max_tool_calls-alias-max_command_count","content":"`required`"},"2195":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-168","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#max_tool_calls-alias-max_command_count","content":"bool"},"2196":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-169","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#max_tool_calls-alias-max_command_count","content":"no"},"2197":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-170","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#max_tool_calls-alias-max_command_count","content":"`true`"},"2198":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-171","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#max_tool_calls-alias-max_command_count","content":"Passes if the number of **tool invocations** the agent made is `<= limit`."},"2199":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-172","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#max_tool_calls-alias-max_command_count","content":"A tool invocation is a structured `tool_use` trace event, plus any `raw_json` trace line — the\nlatter covers backends that still emit tool calls as raw JSON instead of decoded tool events.\nAssistant text output, token-usage events, and unmodelled SDK event variants are **not** counted."},"2200":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-173","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#max_tool_calls-alias-max_command_count","content":"Results use `\"check_name\": \"max_tool_calls\"`. The per-case artifact field counting\nthese events is `command_count`."},"2201":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-174","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#making-a-check-advisory-with-required","content":"Every check type accepts `required` (default `true`). Setting `required = false` makes the check **advisory**: it still runs, and its result still appears in the run artifacts with its own `passed` value, but a failure does not fail the case."},"2202":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-175","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#making-a-check-advisory-with-required","content":"Use it for signal you want visible in reports without gating the suite on it."},"2203":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-176","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#how-a-cases-passfail-is-decided","content":"No `checks` file configured (or it loads zero explicit checks): the case still receives the required trigger expectation generated from `should_trigger`."},"2204":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-177","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#how-a-cases-passfail-is-decided","content":"Any checks loaded: the case **passes** only if every **required** check's `passed` is `true`. Checks marked `required = false` are reported but never fail the case. Among required checks there is no partial credit and no threshold — they are all-or-nothing per case."},"2205":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-178","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#how-a-cases-passfail-is-decided","content":"A case whose checks are **all** advisory (`required = false`) has nothing that can fail it, so it passes as long as it does not time out. That is intentional, but it means an all-optional `checks.toml` is not a safety net."},"2206":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-179","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#how-a-cases-passfail-is-decided","content":"A trial that times out is always `error`, independent of checks."},"2207":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-180","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#how-a-cases-passfail-is-decided","content":"Across trials, `pass_threshold` decides the case's aggregated status: pass rate across trials must be `>= pass_threshold`."},"2208":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-181","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#4-validate-then-run-then-report","content":"Once the manifest, CSV, and checks file exist:"},"2209":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-182","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#4-validate-then-run-then-report","content":"`--output-dir` is **required** on `fastskill eval run` — there is no default. Omitting it fails argument parsing before anything else runs:"},"2210":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-183","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#4-validate-then-run-then-report","content":"`--agent <key>` (repeatable) and `--all` are mutually exclusive on both `eval run` and `eval validate` — passing both errors with `RUNTIME_CONFLICTING_FLAGS`. `eval run` additionally requires one of them (passing neither errors with `RUNTIME_NO_SELECTION`); on `eval validate` both are optional — omit them to validate config without checking any agent's availability."},"2211":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-184","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#4-validate-then-run-then-report","content":"See Run evals for the full day-to-day command set, artifact layout, and CI gating pattern."},"2212":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-185","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#setup-checklist","content":"`[tool.fastskill.eval]` present with a `prompts` path that resolves."},"2213":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-186","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#setup-checklist","content":"Prompts CSV has `id`, `prompt`, `should_trigger` headers (plus `tags` / `workspace_subdir` if you use them)."},"2214":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-187","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#setup-checklist","content":"Each `should_trigger` value reflects the required consultation/non-consultation expectation; explicit `skill_invoked` checks do not contradict it."},"2215":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-188","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#setup-checklist","content":"Outcome correctness is measured separately where consultation alone is insufficient."},"2216":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-189","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#setup-checklist","content":"`fastskill eval validate --all` passes and lists the agent you intend to run against as available."},"2217":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-190","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#setup-checklist","content":"Output directory convention agreed for `--output-dir` (local + CI)."},"2218":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-191","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#see-also","content":"Run evals"},"2219":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-192","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#see-also","content":"Cluster analysis"},"2220":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-193","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#see-also","content":"eval command"},"2221":{"id":"/examples/advanced-patterns","page_id":"/examples/advanced-patterns","type":"page","content":"Advanced Patterns","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Reference","Workflow examples"],"tags":[],"url":"/examples/advanced-patterns"},"2222":{"id":"/examples/advanced-patterns-0","page_id":"/examples/advanced-patterns","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/examples/advanced-patterns","content":"Analyze overlap, optimize skills, filter project groups, and manage editable and global skills."},"2223":{"id":"/examples/advanced-patterns-1","page_id":"/examples/advanced-patterns","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/examples/advanced-patterns#overview","content":"Overview"},"2224":{"id":"/examples/advanced-p